{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a legendary journey across space and time! Step through portals into diverse worlds to hunt fearsome monsters, challenge mighty bosses, and claim hidden treasures. Forge your destiny by mastering weapons, magic, equipment, and classes as you overcome every obstacle in your Cosmic Dream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast\u2011paced melee and ranged combat using a vast arsenal of weapons, magic, equipment, and consumables. Forge unique builds tailored to your playstyle, mastering the art of dodging, blocking, and parrying to topple foes and strike back with devastating counterattacks. Face a wide variety of enemy types, each ready to test your skill at every turn. Battle alone, enlist AI mercenaries, or summon monsters to fight by your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that shifts and transforms, filled with challenges to overcome, secrets to uncover and interesting entities to interact with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes by interacting with the world and overcoming challenges. Each class is unique with it's own set of equipment, weapons and powers. You can mix and match power and equipment from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and mysterious story spanning dimensions of time and space where two souls urge to be together again.  No matter what....Get to Neon City!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends directly from your steam friends list to join you in the world and overcome challenges together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In early access the entire first chapter of the game is playable with the following content and more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Different Weapon Types</strong>: Sword/Shield, Long Sword, Buster Sword, Katana, Spear, Lance, Tome, Staff, Hammer, Axe, Bat, Bow, Crossbow, Claws, Daggers, Dual Daggers and Punching Gloves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>135 Total Weapon Variations</strong>\u00a0with different elemental properties and effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>139 Different Spells</strong> with various elemental properties to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 Classes</strong> to discover and unlock. Each with unique weapons, armor and abilities. You can mix and match to create your own playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Interconnected Levels</strong>\u00a0to discover, explore and conquer! Each with unique monsters, bosses and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > While I\u2019ve worked hard to deliver a fun and complete experience, you may encounter bugs or unfinished content during gameplay. By purchasing in Early Access, you\u2019re directly supporting the ongoing development of the game. Thank you for your support! - Andre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436940?t=1770258874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436940/b549702b9b4a3ba2551363441e7fadb7f3fc2379/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770258874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436940/ccc037399a8602387edc38a2e6053fceed5f9d9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770258874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436940/ccc037399a8602387edc38a2e6053fceed5f9d9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770258874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Game contains blood, fighting and shooting."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a legendary journey across space and time! Step through portals into diverse worlds to hunt fearsome monsters, challenge mighty bosses, and claim hidden treasures. Forge your destiny by mastering weapons, magic, equipment, and classes as you overcome every obstacle in your Cosmic Dream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast\u2011paced melee and ranged combat using a vast arsenal of weapons, magic, equipment, and consumables. Forge unique builds tailored to your playstyle, mastering the art of dodging, blocking, and parrying to topple foes and strike back with devastating counterattacks. Face a wide variety of enemy types, each ready to test your skill at every turn. Battle alone, enlist AI mercenaries, or summon monsters to fight by your side.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that shifts and transforms, filled with challenges to overcome, secrets to uncover and interesting entities to interact with.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes by interacting with the world and overcoming challenges. Each class is unique with it's own set of equipment, weapons and powers. You can mix and match power and equipment from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and mysterious story spanning dimensions of time and space where two souls urge to be together again.  No matter what....Get to Neon City!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends directly from your steam friends list to join you in the world and overcome challenges together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In early access the entire first chapter of the game is playable with the following content and more:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 Different Weapon Types</strong>: Sword/Shield, Long Sword, Buster Sword, Katana, Spear, Lance, Tome, Staff, Hammer, Axe, Bat, Bow, Crossbow, Claws, Daggers, Dual Daggers and Punching Gloves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>135 Total Weapon Variations</strong>\u00a0with different elemental properties and effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>139 Different Spells</strong> with various elemental properties to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35 Classes</strong> to discover and unlock. Each with unique weapons, armor and abilities. You can mix and match to create your own playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Interconnected Levels</strong>\u00a0to discover, explore and conquer! Each with unique monsters, bosses and secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > While I\u2019ve worked hard to deliver a fun and complete experience, you may encounter bugs or unfinished content during gameplay. By purchasing in Early Access, you\u2019re directly supporting the ongoing development of the game. Thank you for your support! - Andre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Andre Mitchell"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436940/header.jpg?t=1770258874","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436940/1053420088/e66710baa066c390333f1dcebb96c56a1359c0f3/1768023243/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768024698","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436940/1053420088/e66710baa066c390333f1dcebb96c56a1359c0f3/1768023243/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768024698","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3436940/1053420088/e66710baa066c390333f1